  "description": "Introducing the Xtreme Route library, your go-to solution for advanced route planning, isochrones, and fleet routing. This comprehensive software library is designed specifically for .NET developers who require robust routing capabilities, and is fully multi-threaded, seamlessly handled within the library—no additional development required.",
