  "releaseNotes": "- Added Rouer.FleetRouteCalculationReport that can be used to get insight into a fleet route calculation, both when calculation succeeded and when it failed.\n- Added support for completing a stop before latest, and not just arriving within the timewindow. Property RouteNode.TimeWindowHandling\n- Fixed a bug when using daily time windows in combination with staggered departures\n- Fixed a bug when a staggered departure could force a sleep break but non-staggered did not\n- Added StaggeredIndex to NodePaths, -1 if not staggered, 0 or higher for which timeslot where used\n- Added property BreakServiceTimeOverlap to NodePath and NodePaths, which is the amount that driver breaks overlap service time (if any).\n- Fixed a few minur bugs for driver breaks.",
